      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-general-cat.html",
        "excerpt": "Factors such as age, activity level and health make a difference in what and how much a cat should eat."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-002",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "水碗每天也需要重新开始",
      "text": "让猫随时能喝到干净的新鲜水，是日常照护的基础。检查时别只看水碗有没有见底，还要把水碗清洗、换水和补水一起完成。ASPCA的基础照护建议是每天清洗并重新加水；把这件事放进固定的喂食流程，比想起来时偶尔加一点更容易持续做到。",
      "topics": [
        "新手养宠",
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-home",
      "source": {
        "title": "General Cat Care",
        "publisher": "ASPCA",
        "author": "ASPCA",
        "url": "https://www.aspca.org/pet-care/cat-care/general-cat-care",
        "checkedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "reviewer": "有宠有邻内容整理",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-general-cat.html",
        "excerpt": "wash and refill your cat’s water bowls daily"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-003",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "抱猫时托住身体前后两端",
      "text": "需要把猫抱起来时，一只手放在前腿后方，另一只手托住后躯，再轻轻抬起，让身体有支撑。不要抓着前腿把猫提起来，也不要拎后颈皮。这个动作的重点是稳妥承托，而不是用力固定某一个部位；与猫接触的人都应了解同样的抱法。",
      "topics": [
        "新手养宠",
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-home",
      "source": {
        "title": "General Cat Care",
        "publisher": "ASPCA",
        "author": "ASPCA",
        "url": "https://www.aspca.org/pet-care/cat-care/general-cat-care",
        "checkedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "reviewer": "有宠有邻内容整理",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-general-cat.html",
        "excerpt": "place one hand behind the front legs and another under the hindquarters"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-004",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "给休息区留一个干净的位置",
      "text": "猫需要属于自己的休息位置，不一定要昂贵，但应保持干燥、清洁，并铺上柔软的毯子或毛巾。日常打理不能只整理表面，寝具也要经常清洗。准备新家用品时，把休息区和可更换的铺垫一起安排好，后续照护就能围绕一处稳定的地方进行。",
      "topics": [
        "新手养宠",
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-home",
      "source": {
        "title": "General Cat Care",
        "publisher": "ASPCA",
        "author": "ASPCA",
        "url": "https://www.aspca.org/pet-care/cat-care/general-cat-care",
        "checkedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "reviewer": "有宠有邻内容整理",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-general-cat.html",
        "excerpt": "Your pet should have her own clean, dry place in your home to sleep and rest."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-005",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "室内猫也值得做好身份识别",
      "text": "主要生活在室内的猫，也可能在出入家门时意外走失。ASPCA提到，身份牌或植入的识别芯片都可帮助走失后的辨认与归还；这项准备并不只属于经常外出的猫。可以向兽医了解适合自己的识别方式，同时检查信息是否便于联系到照护人。",
      "topics": [
        "新手养宠",
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-home",
      "source": {
        "title": "General Cat Care",
