      },
      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-cat-nutrition-tips.html",
        "excerpt": "Over supplementation can result in poisoning with some key vitamins and minerals!"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-009",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "幼猫学吃饭，不要把鼻子按进碗",
      "text": "幼猫从喝奶过渡到固体食物需要逐步学习。原文建议先让幼猫舔食，再慢慢引导到浅碗边，而不是把鼻子按进液体里；这样做可能导致吸入液体。需要人工照护时，先向兽医确认代乳产品和喂养安排，并给幼猫练习的时间，不以一次吃得快慢判断进度。",
      "topics": [
        "新手养宠",
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-home",
      "source": {
        "title": "Cat Nutrition Tips",
        "publisher": "ASPCA",
        "author": "ASPCA",
        "url": "https://www.aspca.org/pet-care/cat-care/cat-nutrition-tips",
        "checkedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "reviewer": "有宠有邻内容整理",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-cat-nutrition-tips.html",
        "excerpt": "Please do not push his nose into the bowl. He may inhale the liquid"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-010",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "自由采食要看这只猫会不会过量",
      "text": "全天放着食物虽然方便，却不一定适合每只成年猫。ASPCA指出，有些猫会在自由采食时吃得过多，进而增加肥胖风险。可以与兽医讨论按份量喂食的方式：先量出当天食物，再按适合家庭和猫的节奏分餐，关注实际吃下多少，而不是不断续满食盆。",
      "topics": [
        "新手养宠",
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-home",
      "source": {
        "title": "Cat Nutrition Tips",
        "publisher": "ASPCA",
        "author": "ASPCA",
        "url": "https://www.aspca.org/pet-care/cat-care/cat-nutrition-tips",
        "checkedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "reviewer": "有宠有邻内容整理",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-cat-nutrition-tips.html",
        "excerpt": "some cats will overeat when fed free-choice, which can result in obesity"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-011",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "牛奶不能代替猫的日常饮水",
      "text": "想给猫一点特别的奖励，不必选择牛奶。ASPCA说明，猫分解乳糖的能力有限，牛奶及相关乳制品可能引起呕吐或腹泻，也不应替代清水。日常继续提供新鲜饮水和适合成长阶段的完整主食；需要额外营养时，应先讨论实际需求，而不是凭人的饮食习惯添加。",
      "topics": [
        "新手养宠",
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-home",
      "source": {
        "title": "Cat Nutrition Tips",
        "publisher": "ASPCA",
        "author": "ASPCA",
        "url": "https://www.aspca.org/pet-care/cat-care/cat-nutrition-tips",
        "checkedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "reviewer": "有宠有邻内容整理",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-cat-nutrition-tips.html",
        "excerpt": "Milk should not be fed to cats as a treat or a substitute for water."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-012",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "猫咪减重先做一份完整计划",
      "text": "猫变胖不只是外形变化，也会增加身体负担。开始减重前，ASPCA建议与兽医一起确认热量需要、食物选择和喂食量，同时增加适合它的活动。把零食、正餐和陪玩机会都纳入日常记录，目标是改变长期过量摄入与活动不足的习惯，而不是只盯着某一天的体重。",
      "topics": [
        "新手养宠",
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-home",
      "source": {
        "title": "Cat Nutrition Tips",
        "publisher": "ASPCA",
        "author": "ASPCA",
        "url": "https://www.aspca.org/pet-care/cat-care/cat-nutrition-tips",
        "checkedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "reviewer": "有宠有邻内容整理",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-cat-nutrition-tips.html",
        "excerpt": "consult your pet’s vet before starting on a weight loss program"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-013",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "生病或术后，饮食也要重新讨论",
      "text": "猫在疾病和术后恢复期间，营养需求可能与平时不同，需要支持组织修复和恢复。ASPCA建议在这些阶段与兽医讨论饮食调整。别只沿用健康时的饭量，也不要自行把各种补品加进食物；带着原来的喂食安排和近期摄食变化，就能更具体地讨论下一步。",
      "topics": [
        "新手养宠",
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-home",
      "source": {
