      },
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "reviewer": "有宠有邻内容整理",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-cat-nutrition-tips.html",
        "excerpt": "Talk to your vet about adjusting your cat’s diet during periods of illness and recovery."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-014",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "猫抗拒护理时，可以先停下来",
      "text": "梳毛或清洁时，如果猫持续挣扎，已经可能伤到自己或照护人，就不适合靠更用力固定来完成。ASPCA建议这类情况预约专业美容人员或兽医处理。日常护理的前提是能够安全进行；把猫抗拒的具体步骤告诉专业人员，有助于选择更合适的照护方式。",
      "topics": [
        "新手养宠",
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-home",
      "source": {
        "title": "Cat Grooming Tips",
        "publisher": "ASPCA",
        "author": "ASPCA",
        "url": "https://www.aspca.org/pet-care/cat-care/cat-grooming-tips",
        "checkedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "reviewer": "有宠有邻内容整理",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-cat-grooming-tips.html",
        "excerpt": "If your cat fights the grooming process, and there is some potential that injury could occur"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-015",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "梳毛时，顺便检查皮肤变化",
      "text": "梳毛不只是把浮毛梳掉，也是观察皮肤与毛发的机会。可以留意脱毛斑、发红、肿块、小伤口或可见寄生虫，并记录发生的位置。ASPCA提醒，明显脱毛或反复舔咬同一处可能有健康原因，应请兽医检查；不要把所有异常都归为普通换毛。",
      "topics": [
        "新手养宠",
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-home",
      "source": {
