      },
      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-cat-litter-box-problems.html",
        "excerpt": "They like to be able to see people or other animals approaching"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-028",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "高入口猫砂盆不适合每只猫",
      "text": "老年猫、关节不适或行动受限的猫，可能难以跨过高边缘或使用顶部入口的猫砂盆。更换用品时，先看它能否轻松进入、转身和离开，而不只看是否防带砂。ASPCA建议尝试低边缘款式；若同时出现疼痛或排泄异常，应先让兽医评估。",
      "topics": [
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-behavior",
      "source": {
        "title": "Litter Box Problems",
