        "reviewedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-cat-older-cats-behavior-problems.html",
        "excerpt": "Don’t assume that your cat is “just getting old” and nothing can be done to help her."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-039",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "老年猫更需要容易预测的日常",
      "text": "对出现迷路或方向混乱的老年猫，稳定的环境可能更容易应对。原文建议尽量保持食物、食碗、猫砂与猫砂盆的位置不变，日程也保持一致。若猫明显难以找到所需物品，应请兽医评估，并在指导下简化活动空间，让资源更容易找到和到达。",
      "topics": [
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-behavior",
      "source": {
        "title": "Older Cats with Behavior Problems",
