      },
      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-cat-older-cats-behavior-problems.html",
        "excerpt": "Avoid changes to her food, food placement, litter and litter box placement."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-040",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "夜里总醒，先排查再调整白天活动",
      "text": "老年猫夜间走动或叫唤增多，可能与睡眠节律、感官变化、疼痛或排泄需要有关。先由兽医检查原因，再逐步恢复规律的作息。ASPCA建议白天和傍晚安排适合猫状态的游戏，帮助建立正常昼夜节奏；不要只靠训斥来阻止夜间活动。",
      "topics": [
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-behavior",
      "source": {
        "title": "Older Cats with Behavior Problems",
