      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-cat-aggression-cats.html",
        "excerpt": "Body language is made up of cats’ body postures, facial expressions, and the position and carriage"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-043",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "抚摸时，它说停就停",
      "text": "有些猫喜欢短暂抚摸，却不喜欢同一处被反复触碰。转头看手、甩尾、耳位变化或开始不安，都可能提示它想结束。ASPCA建议看到停止信号就停下来，而不是等到被咬才判断。每只猫对抚摸、抱起和搂住的接受程度不同，互动长度可以由它决定。",
      "topics": [
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-behavior",
      "source": {
        "title": "Aggression in Cats",
        "publisher": "ASPCA",
