      },
      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-cat-aggression-cats.html",
        "excerpt": "There can be considerable delay between the initial arousal and the redirected aggression, as long as hours."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-046",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "猫之间起冲突，重新见面要循序渐进",
      "text": "同住猫发生冲突后，不要期待让它们打一架就解决。原文建议先分开生活，各自有食碗、床和猫砂盆，再逐步接触气味、隔门相处，依据双方是否放松来推进。出现哈气、挥爪等反应就退回更慢的步骤；冲突严重或持续时，应请兽医或行为专业人员制定方案。",
      "topics": [
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-behavior",
      "source": {
        "title": "Aggression Between Cats in Your Household",
        "publisher": "ASPCA",
        "author": "ASPCA",
        "url": "https://www.aspca.org/pet-care/cat-care/common-cat-behavior-issues/aggression-between-cats-your-household",
        "checkedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "approved",
        "reviewer": "有宠有邻内容整理",
        "reviewedAt": "2026-09-29"
      },
      "images": [],
      "sourceEvidence": {
        "file": "content/batch-001/sources/aspca-cat-aggression-between-cats-your-household.html",
        "excerpt": "Separate your cats in different rooms for several days or weeks, with separate beds, bowls and litter boxes."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge-047",
      "contentType": "knowledge",
      "title": "喷尿标记和不用猫砂盆，不是一回事",
      "text": "喷尿标记常表现为朝垂直表面留下较少尿液，猫也可能继续正常使用猫砂盆。ASPCA强调，这与单纯不愿在盆内排泄的原因不同。可以记录姿势、位置和大致尿量，供兽医与行为评估参考；这些特征是观察线索，不能据此自行排除健康问题。",
      "topics": [
        "养宠经验"
      ],
      "circleId": "circle-cats",
      "editorId": "catalog-cat-behavior",
      "source": {
